    ('four-seasons-spa-ubud', 'c2a531054dc7766950d329cc26984fb5', 'Four Seasons Spa is a day spa in Ubud with 24 treatments on its list, yoga and spa packages among them. There is a couple massage too, and booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('gadsden-massage-studio-ubud', '1cd3c632c37e03b12f0f69fe7b88e859', 'Lomi lomi, Swedish and traditional massage are among the 41 treatments at Gadsden Massage Studio in Ubud, and the list includes a couple treatment.'),
    ('gratia-spa-monkey-forest-ubud', '86ad4f08217dfddc99a1243224fba058', 'Gratia Spa Monkey Forest in Ubud lists 79 treatments, including traditional, Balinese and back massage. The Balinese massage for men is 180K IDR for an hour.'),
    ('green-tara-spa-ubud', '65a48fdbb1cae9e79c2b8ced0991c00f', 'Green Tara Spa''s 14 treatments include reiki, facials and Balinese massage. The Ubud day spa prices its traditional Balinese balance treatment at 240K IDR for an hour, with booking through the spa''s site.'),
    ('hesa-wellness-spa-ubud', 'ef97342d7dcfd1496031eb31c8dc79aa', 'Hesa Wellness Spa in Ubud charges 600K IDR for a 90-minute Balinese massage and takes bookings on its website. A hammam and body scrubs are also on the day spa''s list of 13 treatments.'),
    ('hotel-spa-massage-ubud', '5081b7db6e5f122f676070e864fa1fe6', 'Hotel Spa massage, a resort spa in Ubud that takes bookings on its own website, lists 20 treatments, including traditional massage, Thai massage and shirodhara.'),
    ('inka-ubud-spa-ubud', 'ba207a4f728c450d6b82d5a6b4955452', 'INKA Ubud Spa keeps a short day spa list of four treatments, including traditional massage, a facial and a manicure, and bookings go through Zenoti.'),
    ('jero-traditional-spa-therapy-ubud', 'd5a739abf82054e3c00d8274ee4d4c48', 'Jero Traditional Spa & Therapy is an Ubud day spa that takes bookings by WhatsApp. Traditional Balinese massage is 200K IDR for 60 minutes, and deep tissue and aromatherapy are among its 36 treatments.'),
    ('jhagat-spa-centre-ubud', 'b9f4743ff2dbe1eb68e631e7535eb399', 'Foot massage, reflexology and manicures are on the 57-treatment list at Jhagat Spa Centre in Ubud. This day spa''s foot massage is 190K IDR for 60 minutes, and bookings are on its website.'),
    ('kappa-senses-ubud-ubud', '80a11bf4ccfb0094b1fc276b889858e0', 'Kappa Senses Ubud has a resort spa menu of four treatments that includes a facial, Balinese massage and a couple massage. Traditional Balinese massage is listed at 90K IDR for 60 minutes, and the resort''s own website takes bookings.'),
    ('kaveri-spa-at-the-udaya-ubud', 'aa4679e9f56f82455964e678b1bac269', 'Kaveri Spa, the spa at The Udaya in Ubud, takes bookings on its own website. Its six treatments include Balinese massage and a couple massage.'),
    ('kayumanis-spa-ubud-ubud', '946dc740e7364c0dd57065af1f98fe84', 'Kayumanis Spa Ubud keeps nine treatments on its spa menu, traditional massage and hot stone included. Its relaxing massage costs 1,025K IDR for an hour.'),
    ('lemuria-spa-by-arya-arkananta-resort-spa-ubud', '5de3874bbe8c74ad11e80ca5cb17184a', 'Lemuria Spa by Arya Arkananta Resort & Spa is a day spa in Ubud with four treatments, traditional massage and spa packages among them. Booking is on the venue''s own website.'),
    ('lumiere-spa-bali-ubud', '3c14599ff71c5664d88ea14b599d78e2', 'In Ubud, lumiere spa bali is a day spa with 15 treatments, including aromatherapy, traditional massage and facials, and sessions of up to two hours. Deep back tissue massage there is 380K IDR for an hour.'),
    ('mahamaya-spa-ubud', '11d75abc8657d49d0c03f65144058bdf', 'Mahamaya Spa in Ubud takes bookings through Fresha and has 86 treatments on its menu, including traditional massage, facials and body scrubs. Foot reflexology at this day spa is 390K IDR for an hour.'),
    ('mango-tree-spa-ubud', '3e1fff9d37fe687a784a3fb7e019c84c', 'Ayurvedic treatments, spa packages and Balinese massage are on the 15-treatment list at Mango Tree Spa, a wellness spa in Ubud. Its pure Balinese massage is priced at 1,215K IDR for an hour.'),
    ('melati-spa-ubud', '430e2ed3f69d2cc861ef8d389f4901e2', 'Melati Spa''s Bali foot spa ritual takes an hour and costs 500K IDR. This wellness spa in Ubud has 17 treatments, including spa packages, facials and Balinese massage.'),
    ('mountain-wellness-resort-near-ubud-ubud', '04cc109ec03c4b62ba7a6e2e19038163', 'Mountain Wellness Resort near Ubud is a wellness spa with 11 treatments, including Balinese massage, Ayurvedic treatments and body scrubs.'),
    ('nikmatul-choiroh-semassage-vaccinated-ubud', '3f70693d0e184b79b8edf9fea97c1c40', 'This Ubud massage studio lists five treatments, with a body scrub among them, and takes bookings on its own website.'),
    ('nusa-therapy-ubud', 'c6b3be86ce9965a46358f47c9de7d9d7', 'Foot massage at Nusa Therapy is 95K IDR for an hour. Neck and shoulder work and traditional massage are also on the eight-treatment list at this Ubud day spa, which takes bookings by WhatsApp.'),
    ('parina-spa-ubud', '7d7df2d5e15ecb6a4a59702c329bdc71', 'Deep tissue, Balinese massage and facials are on the ten-treatment list at Parina Spa, a day spa in Ubud. Booking is by WhatsApp, and Balinese massage is 270K IDR for 60 minutes.'),
    ('parina-spa-ubud-ubud', 'ceb2b3bd92cf6ae49cd4a321fe65c8cd', 'Parina Spa Ubud takes reservations on its own website and keeps ten treatments on its day spa list, a flower bath, Balinese massage and aromatherapy among them. The longest takes 160 minutes.'),
    ('pengosekan-spa-hotels-ubud', '782e42baa6435226332afa9225e0ccbb', 'Yoga sits beside Balinese and traditional massage on the four-treatment list at Pengosekan Spa Hotels in Ubud. This wellness spa lists an item called massage services at 643K IDR and takes bookings on its own website.'),
    ('putri-ubud-spa-ubud', '24741df61e33406b3c39ea15d898c7cb', 'Leg massage at Putri Ubud Spa is 250K IDR for 60 minutes. The day spa''s 18 treatments also include ear candling, sports massage and traditional massage, and booking is on the spa''s own website.'),
    ('reflexology-ubud-ubud', '958892b550cbaaee6ba8c0a6df9484f3', 'You book Reflexology Ubud through its website. The wellness spa''s eight treatments include reflexology, Balinese massage and a four-hands massage.'),
    ('riverside-spa-at-ulaman-ubud', 'e6034ea02358d84b88ecb9968eeefdfb', 'Riverside Spa at Ulaman charges 750K IDR for an hour of Balinese massage. Body wraps and hot stone massage are also among the 40 treatments at this Ubud day spa.'),
    ('royal-kirana-spa-ubud', '4c00c2b4203beadecd9be3196020e779', 'A romance retreat for couples costs 2,650K IDR at Royal Kirana Spa, a day spa in Ubud with 14 treatments. Couple massage, spa packages and a flower bath are on the list, and booking is on the spa''s website.'),
    ('royal-spa-wellness-ubud', 'e4823ddddedcd5dcf9df07f5536aaca6', 'Royal Spa & Wellness in Ubud lists four treatments, including a spa package, traditional massage and a facial, and the day spa takes bookings on its own website.'),
    ('sang-spa-ubud', 'fc580395f0ac6dfd22f84e95fadbb743', 'A 90-minute traditional Balinese massage costs 499K IDR at Sang Spa, a wellness spa in Ubud. Its 12 treatments include Balinese and couple massage, and you book on the spa''s website.'),
    ('sanggraloka-ubud-ubud', '11384ac611d31527c51bdb6961b9b7f6', 'Sanggraloka Ubud keeps a short wellness spa list: deep tissue, aromatherapy and a body treatment are among its four treatments. Booking is online, through its own site.'),
    ('serayu-spa-at-the-kayon-resort-ubud', '8a70db9f8cc7ce398b2a1518f7c156c8', 'Serayu Spa at The Kayon Resort in Ubud lists 104 treatments, running from traditional massage and spa packages to haircuts. An hour of foot reflexology at the day spa is 725K IDR.'),
    ('shinto-spa-ubud', 'ea0f0844fd0d3e7adc82e9326131c9ea', 'Bookings at Shinto Spa come in by WhatsApp, and the Ubud day spa has 46 treatments, including traditional massage, head massage and facials. Its 60-minute foot meridian massage is 275K IDR.'),
    ('starchild-spa-ubud', '11db2baeb841034b0af1dc96c51eb3fc', 'StarChild Spa charges 125K IDR for a 60-minute Balinese massage. The Ubud day spa''s 35 treatments also take in body scrubs, spa packages and traditional massage.'),
    ('swatma-ubud', '028a6162be239813be1402f55e1e69f1', 'Swatma is a wellness centre in Ubud where yoga and Balinese massage are among nine treatments. A Balinese healing session costs 350K IDR, and you book on its own website.'),
    ('taksu-ubud', '2c21eb3550727b4dcdf3a39130f1f7b2', 'Taksu in Ubud takes bookings on its own website, and its day spa list has 56 treatments, Balinese massage, manicures and pedicures included.'),
    ('tegal-mesari-spa-ubud', '2b4839abe2afc86db9196912173c9aae', 'Tegal Mesari Spa takes bookings by WhatsApp for its 28 treatments, among them body scrubs, traditional massage and facials. Face massage at this Ubud day spa is 275K IDR for 60 minutes.'),
    ('terakota-spa-ubud', 'bb4449934859e9fe1dcf24062baa87fe', 'Terakota Spa, a day spa in Ubud, charges 115K IDR for an hour of foot and leg massage. Its 11 treatments also include Balinese massage and neck and shoulder work, and you book by WhatsApp.'),
    ('the-faces-world-ubud', '87b0cf850d3ada588a3d5dd100f2e4c3', 'The Faces World lists 63 treatments at its wellness spa in Ubud, including traditional massage, facials and spa packages. Its reflexology foot massage is 500K IDR for 60 minutes, with booking through its website.'),
    ('the-kasih-spa-ubud', 'ed273cb7dbd93de3c85b0230f0d354f3', 'Balinese massage, aromatherapy and head massage are all on the 17-treatment menu at The Kasih Spa in Ubud. The day spa''s own Balinese massage is 250K IDR for an hour, and booking is on its website.'),
    ('the-sacred-river-spa-at-sayan-ubud', 'c13514c726ad3dc36a32e981872a2a90', 'Steam, a hydrating facial and spa packages are on the list at The Sacred River Spa at Sayan, a wellness spa in Ubud with eight treatments.'),
    ('the-samaya-ubud-bali-ubud', '7c507ead8ff05e552ce0b252de74e330', 'The Samaya Ubud-Bali has a resort spa with 15 treatments, among them Balinese massage, a couple massage and facials. A single Balinese massage costs 550K IDR for an hour, and booking is on the resort''s website.'),
    ('the-sanctoo-spa-wellness-ubud', 'ee932f1d6daf53b2406f53cbe9818367', 'The Sanctoo Spa & Wellness is a spa in Ubud with five treatments on its list, one of them an anti-aging facial.'),
    ('the-spa-kamandalu-ubud', 'b279f4921cee81b34ea6cf7b78f56f1d', 'In Ubud, the spa@kamandalu lists 32 treatments, including traditional massage, facials and reflexology. The longest sessions run six hours, and an hour of Balinese massage costs 1,100K IDR.'),
    ('tjampuhan-spa-ubud', '7543c1d50e62c7b9b3ffdc17bceef2b8', 'Tjampuhan Spa, a day spa in Ubud, has a Javanese lulur and a Balinese boreh on its 14-treatment list, next to traditional massage. Booking is on the spa''s website.'),
    ('tlaga-spa-ubud', '731e724c5ade4d32c6e4c8a093f5421c', 'At tlaga spa in Ubud, the 15 treatments include traditional massage, facials and a flower bath. A 60-minute healing massage at this wellness spa costs 475K IDR.')
